the whole game can be run through mouse pointer only, to run the game , you need to run the code
by creating new configuration in android studio software

steps to run the game:
1. extracting the zip file you will see whole codes and assets inside it
2. open android studio
3. locate the files in android studio by tapping open project
4. open with game name
5. Now after openening the file go to build gradle
6. now edit configurations (left upper from play button of code)
7. in -cp select project.lwjgl3.main
8. the you will be able to run the program


